{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc2d Team up with 2\u20134 players and risk your lives to bring the cheese back to the company!<br>One mistake means <strong>zero pay</strong> and a group scolding session for everyone!<br>Still, the mouse employees keep working like worn-out rags\u2026<br>This is a company you should <i>never</i> apply to \u2014 a true black-hearted workplace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527940/extras/e49ba71021c2b28a71a27c756c077341.poster.avif?t=1762766177\" width=1170 height=802 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527940/extras/e49ba71021c2b28a71a27c756c077341.webm?t=1762766177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa4 Features <strong>voice chat</strong>!<br>Work together with your teammates and move quietly so the mysterious creature \u2014 the <i>Cat</i> \u2014 won\u2019t notice you.<br>The moment someone speaks, hell begins!<br>One sneeze\u2026 and the whole company vanishes without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527940/extras/fdc827cd88f6f6dc041fba91db1d3507.poster.avif?t=1762766177\" width=1170 height=802 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527940/extras/fdc827cd88f6f6dc041fba91db1d3507.webm?t=1762766177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddc0 Packed with thrilling gimmicks!<br>Conveyor belts, toasty stoves, avalanches\u2026<br>Each one is a \u201cworkplace\u201d waiting for you.<br>Use them wisely for promotion \u2014 or fail and face instant (physical) resignation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527940/extras/433d8502d75ce14dabc8a8e2b5feef0f.poster.avif?t=1762766177\" width=1170 height=802 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527940/extras/433d8502d75ce14dabc8a8e2b5feef0f.webm?t=1762766177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 No matter how hard they work, the mice are never rewarded.<br>Overtime today, overtime tomorrow.<br>Will peaceful days ever come to this black cheese company\u2026?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527940/extras/52ace13792189bd7af9f6e7e9b3f86ae.poster.avif?t=1762766177\" width=1170 height=802 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527940/extras/52ace13792189bd7af9f6e7e9b3f86ae.webm?t=1762766177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa5 <strong>Streaming Policy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Streaming Platforms</strong><br>Streaming is permitted on any platform, including YouTube and Twitch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content Coverage</strong><br>You may stream and publish the entire game. There are no restrictions or warnings regarding spoilers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monetization &amp; Secondary Use</strong><br>Monetization such as ad revenue, donations (e.g. Super Chat), as well as VOD archives, clips, subtitles, shorts, and re-uploads to other social media are allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Credit Notation</strong><br>Credit notation is optional and not required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prior Approval</strong><br>No prior permission or notification is necessary. Please feel free to stream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collaboration Streams</strong><br>Collaborative streams involving multiple creators are also allowed under the same conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prohibited Actions</strong><br>Extraction or modification of game data, as well as any actions that infringe copyrights, are prohibited.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2527940?t=1762766177","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527940/1dd7de739487d6b762f3cad681f732c8efc24755/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762766177","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527940/406b4ff96b91bab52be13e4c6819702ecce8c6dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762766177","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527940/406b4ff96b91bab52be13e4c6819702ecce8c6dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762766177","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2528020,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc2d Team up with 2\u20134 players and risk your lives to bring the cheese back to the company!<br>One mistake means <strong>zero pay</strong> and a group scolding session for everyone!<br>Still, the mouse employees keep working like worn-out rags\u2026<br>This is a company you should <i>never</i> apply to \u2014 a true black-hearted workplace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vid